        <ObjectList>
          <MultilingualText ID="4" CompositionName="Comment">
            <ObjectList>
              <MultilingualTextItem ID="5" CompositionName="Items">
                <AttributeList>
                  <Culture>en-US</Culture>
                  <Text>Bits 0-4 are negated because SafetyZone1-3/SafetyGate1 read true when the circuit is intact, so a break reads false and NOT is what raises the alarm. Bits 5-7 are not negated: PullCord1/FireDamper1/FireDamper2 already report true-when-triggered from the field device. Bit 0 summarizes bits 1-3 (any zone breach) so the HMI can show one perimeter-alarm indicator without decoding the individual bits.</Text>
                </AttributeList>
              </MultilingualTextItem>
            </ObjectList>
          </MultilingualText>
